---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-sand bg-cream">
  <div class="section-px mx-auto max-w-site py-14">
    <div class="h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-sage/20 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-8">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">CC Counseling</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Thoughtful online therapy for adults and couples seeking steadier support, clearer next steps, and care that feels personal
          from the beginning.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Contact</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Email:
          <a
            class="text-sm font-medium text-sageDark underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-sage hover:underline"
            href="mailto:hello@cccounselingnc.com">hello@cccounselingnc.com</a
          ><br />
          Phone:
          <a
            class="text-sm font-medium text-sageDark underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-sage hover:underline"
            href="tel:+19194571981">(919) 457-1981</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Service area</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Serving North Carolina primarily via telehealth, with select in-person options in Cary and Raleigh when scheduling
          allows.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Quick links</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a
              class="text-sm text-muted underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-sageDark hover:underline"
              href="/">Home</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              class="text-sm text-muted underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-sageDark hover:underline"
              href="/insurance-rates">Insurance &amp; Rates</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              class="text-sm text-muted underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-sageDark hover:underline"
              href="/faq-1">FAQ</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              class="text-sm text-muted underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-sageDark hover:underline"
              href="/contact-get-started">Get Started</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Policies</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a
              class="text-sm text-muted underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-sageDark hover:underline"
              href="/good-faith-estimate">Good Faith Estimate</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              class="text-sm text-muted underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-sageDark hover:underline"
              href="/notice-of-privacy-practices">Notice of Privacy Practices</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 space-y-4 border-t border-line pt-8 text-center text-xs text-muted sm:text-left">
      <p class="text-ink">&copy; {year} CC Counseling. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted">
        This site is not intended for emergencies. If you are in crisis or need immediate support, call or text 988,
        call 911, or go to the nearest emergency room.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
